{"id":21055,"name":"直到明天的明天","rarity":4,"path":"Priest","desc":"丰饶命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「缇里西庇俄丝，明天见……」</i>\\n\\n母亲远行的时分，女孩拭去她脸庞的泪。\\n\\n她等待着一个又一个明天，直到自己也成长为母亲一般的人。\\n她站在门扉之前，紧握火种，耳边响起母亲的话。\\n\\n<i>「那里，没有风雪、严寒与骤雨……」</i>\\n\\n<i>「但如果明天见不到……」</i>\\n\\n她坠向大地，留下稚嫩的身影如流星划过天空——\\n\\n<i>「那就明天的明天见啦！」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":21055,"name":"离别","desc":"使装备者的治疗量提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。我方目标当前生命值百分比大于等于<unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak>时，造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.12,0.5,0.12]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.15,0.5,0.14]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.18,0.5,0.16]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.21,0.5,0.18]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.24,0.5,0.2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":18,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":115001,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":39.6,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110241,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":115001,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":68.4,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110242,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":115002,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":97.2,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110242,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":115002,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":126,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110243,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115003,"ItemNum":5}]},"5":{"hp_base":412.8,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":185.76,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":154.8,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":70,"co